			"notes": "# Mamizou - A NeoForge Mod for Creating NPCs Powered by LLM\n\n## Usage\n\n- Right-click an NPC while holding **Mamizou’s Leaf** to create or edit it.\n- Supports both OpenAI-compatible APIs and the Coze API.\n- NPC skins can be set using:\n    - A player's name,\n    - A pre-stored skin file located at `./config/mamizou/skins/<example>.png` (enter `<example>.png` as the reference),\n      or\n    - A URL.\n- Right-click an NPC to begin a conversation.\n\n## Notes\n\n- Custom in-game prompts are not supported when using Coze API.\n- The task system and voice input features are still under development.\n- Retrieving skins by player name could experience significant delays and poor performance in Mainland China.\n- The plugin is now designed for NeoForge 1.21.1."
		}
